# The ONE pin for every cargo tool that a workflow (.github/workflows/*.yml), the
# devloop image (infra/devloop/Dockerfile) or a service image (infra/docker/*/Dockerfile,
# via infra/kind/scripts/deploy.sh) installs. Read ONLY through
# infra/lib/cargo-tools.sh:cargo_tool_version; never copy a version elsewhere
# (scripts/setup.test.sh fails on a literal or unpinned install anywhere).
#
# Exception: sqlx-cli, whose pin is the workspace's `sqlx` in Cargo.lock
# (infra/lib/cargo-lock-version.sh), so the CLI and library always agree.
#
# Bump deliberately: CI picks the new version up on the next run; devloop and
# run-story containers need `infra/devloop/devloop.sh --rebuild` (Layer 4 fails
# with CARGO_NEXTEST_VERSION_MISMATCH until then).
#
# Format: `<crate> <X.Y.Z>`, one per line.
cargo-nextest 0.9.146
cargo-audit 0.22.2
# The coverage job's comments assert cargo-llvm-cov 0.8.x behaviour (show-env
# wrapper flow); re-verify them before moving off 0.8.
cargo-llvm-cov 0.8.7
cargo-fuzz 0.13.2
# The four service images' cargo-chef (dependency-layer caching).
cargo-chef 0.1.78
